description:
We are looking for a  Lead Java JEE Developer (M/F)  for our client, a multinational IT services company. 
	   
	  Position & Mission :  
	   
	 Working as part of the R&D Department within the Technical Architecture department of the Development teams, in charge of specific technical areas, your scope will include. 

	 Design and technical development using Java/JEE technologies; 
	 Development and maintenance of the software package framework; 
	 Instruction and debugging of advanced technical problems; 
	 Participation in the costing and design of technical components; 
	 Level 3 support for business developers on questions relating to the Framework; 
	 Investigation of Java/database/network performance...+plus

